XPU: one GPU per TP worker (VLLM_XPU_ISOLATE_WORKERS=1).

Spawns each worker with ZE_AFFINITY_MASK=<its device> so every process gets a
single-device Level Zero context, and maps the worker/process-group device to
xpu:0. Works around the 1:1 host-RAM mirror of every device allocation that
compute-runtime 26.09-26.31 creates for multi-device contexts
(intel/compute-runtime#980). Requires CCL_TOPO_P2P_ACCESS=0. Not needed on
compute-runtime >= 26.35, and not compatible with 0004 (no P2P).

